	(text "S1 (8251 at 05D0h or 07D0h -> A9) and S2 (8255 at 0A50h or 0B50h ->\nA8): DIP switch to GND + 10k pull-up, so open = 1, closed = 0.\nDecoder chips: NOT placed yet. Write the chip-select equations first\n(see the I/O decoding doc), then choose the parts."
